@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor white
skinparam PackageBorderColor black
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam minClassWidth 220
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 80
hide circle
hide empty members
package "批次位置与库存余额" as S {
' @reference material_batch
class "材料批次" as batch_s <<entity>>
' @reference inventory_movement
class "库存变动" as movement_s <<entity>>
class "存放位置" as stock_location <<entity>> {
 位置名称、用途、启用状态
 --
 +核对位置用途及可用性()
}
class "批次存量" as batch_stock <<entity>> {
 基本单位账面数量、库存版本
 --
 +核对批次位置唯一性()
 +核对当前量及版本()
 +按合法变动更新余额()
}
batch_s "1" -- "0..*" batch_stock
stock_location "1" -- "0..*" batch_stock
batch_stock "1" -- "0..*" movement_s
batch_s -[hidden]right- stock_location
note bottom of batch_stock
1采购单位＝n/d基本单位，按确认精度精确换算。
初建量为0，数量由有据入库及后续变动形成。
余额后＝余额前＋变动≥0，不能直接覆盖余额。
end note
}
@enduml
